  "2026-07-25T00:13:48.812Z",codex-searxng-agent,"All 54 item records across every status, tracker activity, graph analytics, validation, prior GitHub delivery, current upstream docs/source, live LAN config/search behavior, and registry dependency state were inspected before creation; no duplicate active or terminal item covers this new delta."
  "2026-07-25T00:25:49.699Z",codex-searxng-agent,"Correction after source inspection: week time-range parity was already complete in types, parser, MCP, docs, cache keys, and tests. No duplicate implementation was added. The concrete CLI defect is the hidden 5 MiB persistent-load refusal despite unlimited-cache documentation."
  "2026-07-25T00:31:48.958Z",codex-searxng-agent,"Pre-commit acceptance: quality passes with 938 tests and exact 100/100/100/100 coverage; 20/20 module docstrings; type-aware ESLint, Prettier, jscpd, and ShellCheck pass; Bun audit and Trivy report zero findings; history secret scan, changelog checks, npx/bunx package smoke, and isolated installed CLI live LAN E2E pass. Direct release:dry-run correctly requires the next calendar version and will be exercised through release:pipeline:dry-run after commit."
  "2026-07-25T00:47:05.326Z",codex-searxng-agent,"CodeRabbit review identified stale initial week-parity metadata. The source discovery had already corrected the implementation direction; canonical title,scope,outcomes,and step evidence are now aligned to unlimited persistence and secure tooling."
  "2026-07-25T00:48:47.816Z",codex-searxng-agent,"Bot finding on PM test evidence verified: the Plan already had four first-class linked tests,three of which were executed via pm test --run. Added the exact agent-guidance cache command as a fifth linked test to make the regression path explicit."
  "2026-07-25T00:51:30.948Z",codex-searxng-agent,"The generated AGENTS quickstart example node scripts/run-tests.mjs test -- ... is not valid in this repository because that script does not exist. Its PM-linked acceptance failed transparently,was removed,and was replaced by the repository-native bunx vitest run tests/unit/cache.test.ts command,which passes."
  "2026-07-25T00:51:58.383Z",codex-searxng-agent,"text=The generated AGENTS quickstart example node scripts/run-tests.mjs test -- ... is not valid in this repository because that script does not exist. Its PM-linked acceptance failed transparently, was removed, and was replaced by the repository-native bun run test:watch -- run tests/unit/cache.test.ts command."
  "2026-07-25T00:52:38.713Z",codex-searxng-agent,"text=Detailed all-state upstream search found existing pm-cli issue #529 for the invalid generated run-tests.mjs guidance, so no duplicate was created. No duplicate covered silently ignored Plan scope mutations; filed https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/690 with exact 2026.7.24-3 reproduction."
notes[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-25T00:13:48.812Z",codex-searxng-agent,"Preserve JSON-first then HTML fallback because the governed instance intentionally returns HTTP 403 for format=json. Preserve TOON 4.0 default, ~/.searxng-cli global state, setup wizard, unlimited cache, and raw parameter passthrough."
  "2026-07-25T00:25:49.699Z",codex-searxng-agent,TypeScript 7.0 has no compiler API. The official supported arrangement is native TypeScript 7 for tsc plus TypeScript 6 for tools such as typescript-eslint; package scripts select the native binary explicitly.
  "2026-07-25T00:48:47.816Z",codex-searxng-agent,"Plan scope option on pm plan resume/approve was accepted but did not update the existing scope field. Canonical title,description,body,outcomes,evidence,tags,and resume context now carry the corrected scope; this appears to be a pm-cli mutation-contract defect and will be searched before reporting upstream."
  "2026-07-25T00:52:38.713Z",codex-searxng-agent,"Review round 1: all six CodeRabbit findings were validated. Five drove direct improvements; tracker-linked tests already existed,and the suggested exact generated command exposed known pm-cli issue #529,so the repository-native PM-linked focused test was used instead."
learnings[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-25T00:13:48.812Z",codex-searxng-agent,"Upstream SearchQuery and engine request contracts include week in addition to day, month, and year; the CLI must treat this as a first-class typed value rather than requiring raw passthrough."
  "2026-07-25T00:25:49.699Z",codex-searxng-agent,A declared unlimited in-memory cache is not genuinely unlimited across restarts if persistence silently refuses files above a fixed threshold; acceptance must cross the former boundary with valid data.
