body: "Deliver one cohesive persistence, compatibility, and security increment. Persistent files beyond the former 5 MiB boundary must reload through both plain and compression-enabled paths, while raw SearXNG parameters, global ~/.searxng-cli state, TOON default output, setup, and live HTML fallback remain intact. Dependency updates must be API-verified from installed packages and retain every strict gate. Release completion includes installed npx/Bun behavior, exact-head reviews, merge, publication, and daily automation."
